1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:03,034
Bu — ZAMIN FK stadioni.

2
00:00:03,054 --> 00:00:05,747
O'n yetti mingdan ortiq o'rindiq.

3
00:00:05,767 --> 00:00:07,711
Uni muxlislar to'ldiradi.

4
00:00:07,731 --> 00:00:11,404
Har bir obunachi — bitta virtual muxlis.

5
00:00:11,424 --> 00:00:13,295
Stadionda bitta o'rin.

6
00:00:13,315 --> 00:00:18,030
Obuna bo'ling, izoh qoldiring — ismingiz o'z o'rningizda turadi!

7
00:00:18,050 --> 00:00:21,942
Har yangi qismda stadion qanday to'layotganini ko'rasiz.

8
00:00:21,971 --> 00:00:24,936
O'n yetti ming olti yuz yetmish to'rt o'rindiq.

9
00:00:24,976 --> 00:00:27,225
Ming ikki yuz tasi band!

10
00:00:27,245 --> 00:00:29,982
Yana o'n olti mingdan ko'proq joy bor.

11
00:00:30,002 --> 00:00:32,120
Lekin tezlik bilan to'lmoqda!

12
00:00:32,140 --> 00:00:35,906
Birinchi ikki ming muxlis — klubning asoschilari.

13
00:00:35,926 --> 00:00:38,661
Ellik kishi — to'la avtobus.

14
00:00:38,741 --> 00:00:41,288
Ming kishi — butun mahalla!

15
00:00:41,308 --> 00:00:43,879
Keyingi qurilishni ham siz tanlaysiz.

16
00:00:43,899 --> 00:00:46,199
Do'stingiz futbolni yaxshi ko'radimi?

17
00:00:46,219 --> 00:00:47,285
Ulashing!

18
00:00:47,305 --> 00:00:50,326
Obuna bo'ling — o'rningizni band qiling!

